 3
Create tables DEPT11 and EMP11 from DEPT1 and EMP1.
(Create using Sub Query)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------

sql> CREATE TABLE DEPT11
     AS
     SELECT *
     FROM DEPT1
     WHERE 1=2;

Output:
-------

Table created.


SQL Command:
------------

sql> CREATE TABLE EMP11
     AS
     SELECT *
     FROM EMP1
     WHERE 1=2;

Output:
-------

Table created.
